    "article_summary": "The article describes a photoredox-catalyzed cascade radical cyclization for the synthesis of indole-fused 1,4-diazepinones. Using Ir(ppy)3 as a photocatalyst and aroyl chlorides as acyl radical precursors, the method transforms N-indolyl phenylacrylamides into polycyclic structures with N-C(aryl) axial chirality in high yields (up to 99%).",
